# Project orchestration

When the request is a large feature, multi-subsystem change, or the user asks to
orchestrate / parallelize / break work across agents, read and follow:

`.cursor/skills/project-orchestrator/SKILL.md`

- Score complexity technically (not calendar time).
- Band S → implement yourself; M/L/XL → contract → parallel Task workers → verify → integrate.
- Cap concurrent workers at 4 per wave; never assign two writers to the same file in one wave.
- Orchestrator owns integration and final validation.
